cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these result records, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Domain-Complete Evaluation of Distribution Shift in Histopathology (code and result records)"
abstract: >-
  Eleven robustness interventions evaluated on three histopathology cohorts
  (Camelyon17-WILDS, MIDOG 2021, multi-scanner canine SCC) with each domain
  held out in turn. Contains the full pipeline, 388 experimental records,
  variance-decomposition and power code, and the scripts that regenerate every
  table and figure in the paper.
